<title>USA: TABLE-Prime Hospitality Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Prime Hospitality Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, N.J. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>PRIME HOSPITALITY CORP</p>
<p>					  Three Months Ended June 30,</p>
<p>							 1997     1996</p>
<p>  Total revenues				   $83,407  $69,892</p>
<p>  Recurring income				 $11,825   $7,163</p>
